{"data": [{"author_id": "28173220", "created_at": "2026-11-04T15:23:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118001256413147419"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gk8n8amiCM", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/idtdna/status/2118001256413147419/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118001252000825344", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/gk8n8amiCM"}]}, "id": "2118001256413147419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Improving prime editing efficiency and finding the right base editor take more than individual tools. Together with Aldevron, we’re bringing complementary expertise across Danaher together to help researchers tackle these challenges.\n\nOur expanded mRNA portfolio connects IDT’s https://t.co/gk8n8amiCM", "url": "https://x.com/idtdna/status/2118001256413147419"}, {"author_id": "20198534", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:48:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117614977724920236"], "id": "2117614977724920236", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 135, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Companies developing gene therapies are pursuing new avenues of treatment, including base editing and prime editing techniques, that they hope will attract investment and will prove beneficial to patients. 1/2", "url": "https://x.com/C_G_S/status/2117614977724920236"}, {"author_id": "21558596", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:10:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117937464648069537"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "https://www.youtube.com/post/UgkxUptw1pISaG-fPaKQwuQIHe9sCZCmi0J3", "display_url": "lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/c…", "end": 192, "expanded_url": "https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/crispr-and-base-editing-can-we-correct-disease-causing-dna-mutations-what-if-scientists-could-modify-the-genetic-instructions-responsible-for-certain-inher-youtube", "images": [{"height": 1254, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117937477189042176/KJcz6VqV?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1254}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117937477189042176/KJcz6VqV?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 169, "status": 200, "title": "CRISPR And Base Editing: Can We Correct Disease-Causing DNA Mutations? What If Scientists Could Modify The Genetic Instructions Responsible For Certain Inher… — YouTube – Lifeboat News: The Blog", "unwound_url": "https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/crispr-and-base-editing-can-we-correct-disease-causing-dna-mutations-what-if-scientists-could-modify-the-genetic-instructions-responsible-for-certain-inher-youtube", "url": "https://t.co/xQdVBT8HVp"}]}, "id": "2117937464648069537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 83, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CRISPR And Base Editing: Can We Correct Disease-Causing DNA Mutations? What If Scientists Could Modify The Genetic Instructions Responsible For Certain Inher… — YouTube https://t.co/xQdVBT8HVp", "url": "https://x.com/LifeboatHQ/status/2117937464648069537"}, {"author_id": "18244332", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:19:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117683094123643243"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 0, "tag": "CRISPR"}], "mentions": [{"end": 92, "id": "108330095", "start": 82, "username": "ShellyFan"}], "urls": [{"description": "The first patient received a dose of the high-precision gene editor in a new clinical trial for Wilson disease. Researchers hope it's a one-and-done fix.", "display_url": "singularityhub.com/2026/10/29/cri…", "end": 123, "expanded_url": "https://singularityhub.com/2026/10/29/crispr-prime-editing-rewrites-dna-in-the-human-body-for-the-first-time/", "images": [{"height": 929, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115907556568657920/RZWWJ-TD?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1300}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115907556568657920/RZWWJ-TD?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 100, "status": 200, "title": "CRISPR Prime Editing Rewrites DNA in the Human Body for the First Time", "unwound_url": "https://singularityhub.com/2026/10/29/crispr-prime-editing-rewrites-dna-in-the-human-body-for-the-first-time/", "url": "https://t.co/VEzpFnQXPT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/F8TejDDp3w", "end": 147, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ahier/status/2117683094123643243/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117683091510607873", "start": 124, "url": "https://t.co/F8TejDDp3w"}]}, "id": "2117683094123643243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 401, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "#CRISPR Prime Editing Rewrites DNA in the Human Body for the First Time       \nby @ShellyFan      \n\nhttps://t.co/VEzpFnQXPT https://t.co/F8TejDDp3w", "url": "https://x.com/ahier/status/2117683094123643243"}, {"author_id": "413308631", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:39:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118050431809007758"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/e9OsDn2aPq", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/StJudeResearch/status/2118050431809007758/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118050401001861120", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/e9OsDn2aPq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/e9OsDn2aPq", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/StJudeResearch/status/2118050431809007758/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118050406597079040", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/e9OsDn2aPq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/e9OsDn2aPq", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/StJudeResearch/status/2118050431809007758/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118050413534412800", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/e9OsDn2aPq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/e9OsDn2aPq", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/StJudeResearch/status/2118050431809007758/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118050422883565570", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/e9OsDn2aPq"}]}, "id": "2118050431809007758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 258, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "More than 350 disease-causing variants in HBB have been linked to β-thalassemia, but advances in hemoglobin research are opening new paths for treatment. St. Jude scientists are studying complementary strategies to reduce toxic α-globin buildup and restore functional hemoglobin. https://t.co/e9OsDn2aPq", "url": "https://x.com/StJudeResearch/status/2118050431809007758"}, {"author_id": "1713988427933466624", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:24:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117956083067261026"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/MYmK1TiuS1", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SciTechera/status/2117956083067261026/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117956036355379204", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/MYmK1TiuS1"}]}, "id": "2117956083067261026", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1011, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Today i learned that scientists have, for the first time in a human patient with this disease, successfully corrected a disease-causing DNA mutation directly inside the liver. 🤯\n\nit's called in vivo base editing, and it could change how we treat inherited genetic diseases.\n\n&gt; https://t.co/MYmK1TiuS1", "url": "https://x.com/SciTechera/status/2117956083067261026"}, {"author_id": "1935697676160364544", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:02:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117980838683869417"], "id": "2117980838683869417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "One letter. That's the whole typo behind alpha-1 antitrypsin deficiency, an inherited condition that slowly damages the lungs and liver. Doctors have been able to manage it, but never fix it.\n\nNow a team from Hannover Medical School in Germany and Renji Hospital in Shanghai says", "url": "https://x.com/bluetomis/status/2117980838683869417"}, {"author_id": "2110437865809174528", "created_at": "2026-11-03T17:36:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117672168070787289"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 178, "start": 166, "tag": "BaseEditing"}, {"end": 192, "start": 179, "tag": "PrimeEditing"}], "urls": [{"description": "Can rewriting DNA change the future for families living with rare g...", "display_url": "youtu.be/bsjvU2BFTxo", "end": 246, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/bsjvU2BFTxo", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116571689635270656/QNblELZ9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116571689635270656/QNblELZ9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 223, "status": 200, "title": "David Liu: Gene Editing to Treat Rare Disease", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bsjvU2BFTxo&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/r1ZeMwY5IQ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/gbp7eeRKnK", "end": 270, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GENErationHopee/status/2117672168070787289/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117672097057042433", "start": 247, "url": "https://t.co/gbp7eeRKnK"}]}, "id": "2117672168070787289", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The scientists behind base and prime editing: Dr. David R. Liu credits the three postdocs who led the first base editor, the adenine base editor, and prime editing.\n\n#BaseEditing #PrimeEditing\n\nWatch the full conversation: https://t.co/r1ZeMwY5IQ https://t.co/gbp7eeRKnK", "url": "https://x.com/GENErationHopee/status/2117672168070787289"}, {"author_id": "935470082238529541", "created_at": "2026-11-03T07:21:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117517502439936189"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 244, "start": 231, "tag": "PrimeEditing"}, {"end": 257, "start": 245, "tag": "GeneEditing"}, {"end": 270, "start": 258, "tag": "GeneTherapy"}, {"end": 279, "start": 271, "tag": "Biotech"}], "urls": [{"description": "Prime Editing Market: Explore growth from USD 2.20 Bn in 2025 to USD 10.10 Bn by 2034 at 18.49% CAGR, driven by precise gene correction and therapy opportunities.", "display_url": "polarismarketresearch.com/industry-analy…", "end": 229, "expanded_url": "https://www.polarismarketresearch.com/industry-analysis/prime-editing-market", "start": 206, "status": 200, "title": "Prime Editing Market Size to Hit USD 10.10 Bn by 2034", "unwound_url": "https://www.polarismarketresearch.com/industry-analysis/prime-editing-market", "url": "https://t.co/Qpij4j1pC7"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/A9pqkOmuPN", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/polaris_mrc/status/2117517502439936189/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117517494621708288", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/A9pqkOmuPN"}]}, "id": "2117517502439936189", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Prime editing could correct up to 89% of disease-causing genetic variants!\n\nPrime Editing Market is projected to grow from USD 2.20 billion in 2025 to USD 10.10 billion by 2034 | CAGR of 18.49%\n\nRead More:\nhttps://t.co/Qpij4j1pC7\n\n#PrimeEditing #GeneEditing #GeneTherapy #Biotech https://t.co/A9pqkOmuPN", "url": "https://x.com/polaris_mrc/status/2117517502439936189"}, {"author_id": "1410008852171411461", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:25:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117427959372063189"], "id": "2117427959372063189", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Doctors corrected a single wrong DNA letter inside a patient's liver, and the liver started making a working protein again.\n\n🧬 Alpha-1 antitrypsin deficiency comes from one misplaced letter in one gene. The liver makes a faulty protein that clumps instead of travelling to", "url": "https://x.com/CouncilShiba/status/2117427959372063189"}, {"author_id": "1580408538119417856", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:57:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117737904483221561"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Wang, Zittersteijn et al. show that the chromatin landscape of a target sequence is a key determinant of DSB-free genome-editing outcomes. Strikingly, while heterochromatin often impairs prime editing, it can enhance base editing and additionally control the fidelity and purity of the DNA modification products generated.", "display_url": "cell.com/molecular-cell…", "end": 146, "expanded_url": "https://www.cell.com/molecular-cell/abstract/S1097-2765(26)00717-3", "images": [{"height": 375, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117737904881688576/tNbNs5ob?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 375}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117737904881688576/tNbNs5ob?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 123, "status": 200, "title": "The chromatin context differently impacts prime editors and base editors and controls the fidelity and purity of base editing", "unwound_url": "https://www.cell.com/molecular-cell/abstract/S1097-2765(26)00717-3", "url": "https://t.co/AbHvRZkXyt"}]}, "id": "2117737904483221561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 248, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "標的DNAのクロマチン状態がprime editingと塩基編集に異なる影響を与え、ヘテロクロマチンはprime editingを抑える一方で塩基編集を高め、編集産物の正確性や純度も左右することを示した論文がMol Cell誌に発表されました。\nhttps://t.co/AbHvRZkXyt", "url": "https://x.com/iPatho1/status/2117737904483221561"}, {"author_id": "191281008", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:11:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117651009753518127"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 39, "start": 34, "tag": "BEAM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VCX44x6RMr", "end": 83, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/zhaoweiasu/status/211765100